  ('ai:ai-batch-08:1a45c6cd2ddd','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Why did Tom start cycling to work?',array['His car kept breaking down.','He wanted to lose weight.','He moved closer to his office.','His doctor told him to.']::text[],'A','''When Tom''s car broke down for the third time in a month, he decided not to repair it.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','When Tom''s car broke down for the third time in a month, he decided not to repair it. Instead, he bought a second-hand bike and started cycling the eight kilometres to his office in Leicester. The first week was hard: his legs hurt and he arrived at work hot and tired. But after a month he was enjoying the ride, and he had lost three kilos. He now saves about £150 a month on petrol and parking. The only thing he doesn''t like is cycling in heavy rain, so on very wet days he takes the bus.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:f0606c745ce6','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How did Tom feel during the first week?',array['excited and relaxed','bored','happy and fit','tired and sore']::text[],'D','''His legs hurt and he arrived at work hot and tired.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','When Tom''s car broke down for the third time in a month, he decided not to repair it. Instead, he bought a second-hand bike and started cycling the eight kilometres to his office in Leicester. The first week was hard: his legs hurt and he arrived at work hot and tired. But after a month he was enjoying the ride, and he had lost three kilos. He now saves about £150 a month on petrol and parking. The only thing he doesn''t like is cycling in heavy rain, so on very wet days he takes the bus.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:af2d0008b90b','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How much does Tom save each month?',array['nothing','about £15','about £150','about £8']::text[],'C','''He now saves about £150 a month on petrol and parking.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','When Tom''s car broke down for the third time in a month, he decided not to repair it. Instead, he bought a second-hand bike and started cycling the eight kilometres to his office in Leicester. The first week was hard: his legs hurt and he arrived at work hot and tired. But after a month he was enjoying the ride, and he had lost three kilos. He now saves about £150 a month on petrol and parking. The only thing he doesn''t like is cycling in heavy rain, so on very wet days he takes the bus.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:3943baaa048c','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What does Tom do on very wet days?',array['cycles anyway','takes the bus','works from home','drives his car']::text[],'B','''On very wet days he takes the bus.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','When Tom''s car broke down for the third time in a month, he decided not to repair it. Instead, he bought a second-hand bike and started cycling the eight kilometres to his office in Leicester. The first week was hard: his legs hurt and he arrived at work hot and tired. But after a month he was enjoying the ride, and he had lost three kilos. He now saves about £150 a month on petrol and parking. The only thing he doesn''t like is cycling in heavy rain, so on very wet days he takes the bus.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:15f71e4240da','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What is the main benefit of the app, according to the reviewer?',array['It writes your essays.','It has no adverts.','It creates a revision timetable.','It never crashes.']::text[],'C','''...it creates a timetable for you.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','I downloaded ''StudyBuddy'', a free app that helps students organise their revision. You enter your exam dates and subjects, and it creates a timetable for you. It also sends reminders and lets you test yourself with flashcards. I found it really useful, although the free version shows quite a lot of adverts. The paid version (£2.99 a month) removes them and adds progress reports. My only real complaint is that it sometimes crashes when you add a lot of subjects.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:75f683a94cf9','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What does the paid version add?',array['more subjects','flashcards','no adverts and progress reports','exam dates']::text[],'C','''The paid version... removes them and adds progress reports.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','I downloaded ''StudyBuddy'', a free app that helps students organise their revision. You enter your exam dates and subjects, and it creates a timetable for you. It also sends reminders and lets you test yourself with flashcards. I found it really useful, although the free version shows quite a lot of adverts. The paid version (£2.99 a month) removes them and adds progress reports. My only real complaint is that it sometimes crashes when you add a lot of subjects.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:4fce44eb107b','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What is the reviewer''s main complaint?',array['It has no reminders.','It sometimes crashes with many subjects.','It is hard to download.','It is too expensive.']::text[],'B','''It sometimes crashes when you add a lot of subjects.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','I downloaded ''StudyBuddy'', a free app that helps students organise their revision. You enter your exam dates and subjects, and it creates a timetable for you. It also sends reminders and lets you test yourself with flashcards. I found it really useful, although the free version shows quite a lot of adverts. The paid version (£2.99 a month) removes them and adds progress reports. My only real complaint is that it sometimes crashes when you add a lot of subjects.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:83411602420a','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What is the reviewer''s overall opinion?',array['they deleted it','they prefer paper timetables','completely negative','positive, with a few problems']::text[],'D','''I found it really useful, although...''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','I downloaded ''StudyBuddy'', a free app that helps students organise their revision. You enter your exam dates and subjects, and it creates a timetable for you. It also sends reminders and lets you test yourself with flashcards. I found it really useful, although the free version shows quite a lot of adverts. The paid version (£2.99 a month) removes them and adds progress reports. My only real complaint is that it sometimes crashes when you add a lot of subjects.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:0859753f4b6a','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What problem does the tree cause for Alan?',array['It fell on his house.','It attracts insects.','It damaged his car.','It blocks light from his kitchen.']::text[],'D','''...it now blocks most of the light from my kitchen window.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Dear Mrs Jones, I''m writing about the tree in your garden next to my house. Over the last few years it has grown very tall, and it now blocks most of the light from my kitchen window. Some branches also hang over my fence, and their leaves fill my garden in autumn. I wonder if you would consider cutting it back a little. I would be happy to share the cost. Perhaps we could talk about it this weekend? Best wishes, Alan (number 14)',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:d2fe279664af','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What does Alan offer?',array['to share the cost of cutting it','to cut it down himself','to buy a new fence','to move house']::text[],'A','''I would be happy to share the cost.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Dear Mrs Jones, I''m writing about the tree in your garden next to my house. Over the last few years it has grown very tall, and it now blocks most of the light from my kitchen window. Some branches also hang over my fence, and their leaves fill my garden in autumn. I wonder if you would consider cutting it back a little. I would be happy to share the cost. Perhaps we could talk about it this weekend? Best wishes, Alan (number 14)',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:8c9b1914fad9','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What is the tone of Alan''s letter?',array['polite and friendly','humorous','very formal and cold','angry and threatening']::text[],'A','He uses phrases like ''I wonder if you would consider...''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Dear Mrs Jones, I''m writing about the tree in your garden next to my house. Over the last few years it has grown very tall, and it now blocks most of the light from my kitchen window. Some branches also hang over my fence, and their leaves fill my garden in autumn. I wonder if you would consider cutting it back a little. I would be happy to share the cost. Perhaps we could talk about it this weekend? Best wishes, Alan (number 14)',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:7eb46ff2a81d','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What happens in Alan''s garden in autumn?',array['It fills with leaves from the tree.','It floods.','It gets no sun at all.','The fence falls down.']::text[],'A','''Their leaves fill my garden in autumn.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Dear Mrs Jones, I''m writing about the tree in your garden next to my house. Over the last few years it has grown very tall, and it now blocks most of the light from my kitchen window. Some branches also hang over my fence, and their leaves fill my garden in autumn. I wonder if you would consider cutting it back a little. I would be happy to share the cost. Perhaps we could talk about it this weekend? Best wishes, Alan (number 14)',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:d07e9674a725','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How much sleep do most adults need?',array['five to six hours','exactly eight hours','seven to nine hours','ten hours']::text[],'C','''Most adults need between seven and nine hours.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Most adults need between seven and nine hours of sleep a night, but many people regularly get less. Scientists say that lack of sleep can affect our memory, our mood and even our immune system. Some simple habits can help: going to bed at the same time every night, avoiding coffee in the afternoon and keeping phones out of the bedroom. The blue light from screens can make it harder for the brain to prepare for sleep.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:1af3cc322404','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Which effect of too little sleep is NOT mentioned?',array['weight gain','bad mood','poor memory','weaker immune system']::text[],'A','The text mentions memory, mood and the immune system.',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Most adults need between seven and nine hours of sleep a night, but many people regularly get less. Scientists say that lack of sleep can affect our memory, our mood and even our immune system. Some simple habits can help: going to bed at the same time every night, avoiding coffee in the afternoon and keeping phones out of the bedroom. The blue light from screens can make it harder for the brain to prepare for sleep.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:48d7a1de160e','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Why should phones be kept out of the bedroom?',array['They use electricity.','They get too hot.','They are noisy.','Screen light makes it harder to prepare for sleep.']::text[],'D','''The blue light from screens can make it harder for the brain to prepare for sleep.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Most adults need between seven and nine hours of sleep a night, but many people regularly get less. Scientists say that lack of sleep can affect our memory, our mood and even our immune system. Some simple habits can help: going to bed at the same time every night, avoiding coffee in the afternoon and keeping phones out of the bedroom. The blue light from screens can make it harder for the brain to prepare for sleep.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:6f649d4b4d96','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Which habit does the text recommend?',array['drinking coffee in the evening','going to bed at the same time every night','reading on your phone','sleeping in the afternoon']::text[],'B','''...going to bed at the same time every night.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Most adults need between seven and nine hours of sleep a night, but many people regularly get less. Scientists say that lack of sleep can affect our memory, our mood and even our immune system. Some simple habits can help: going to bed at the same time every night, avoiding coffee in the afternoon and keeping phones out of the bedroom. The blue light from screens can make it harder for the brain to prepare for sleep.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:50801549f8f2','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What will the old market hall become?',array['a shopping centre','a concert hall','a food hall','a car park']::text[],'C','''...will reopen next spring as a food hall.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','The old market hall in the town centre, which closed five years ago, will reopen next spring as a food hall. More than twenty local businesses will sell food from around the world, and there will be space for live music at weekends. The council hopes the project will bring more visitors to the town centre, where many shops have closed recently. However, some residents are worried about noise late at night.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:8bebf2c5a3f8','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Why does the council support the project?',array['to build new homes','to stop live music','to bring more visitors to the town centre','to sell the building']::text[],'C','''The council hopes the project will bring more visitors to the town centre.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','The old market hall in the town centre, which closed five years ago, will reopen next spring as a food hall. More than twenty local businesses will sell food from around the world, and there will be space for live music at weekends. The council hopes the project will bring more visitors to the town centre, where many shops have closed recently. However, some residents are worried about noise late at night.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:b442f0146091','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What worries some local people about the food hall?',array['noise late at night','parking','the old building falling down','food prices']::text[],'A','''Some residents are worried about noise late at night.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','The old market hall in the town centre, which closed five years ago, will reopen next spring as a food hall. More than twenty local businesses will sell food from around the world, and there will be space for live music at weekends. The council hopes the project will bring more visitors to the town centre, where many shops have closed recently. However, some residents are worried about noise late at night.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:20cf2c5f15b4','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How many businesses will sell food there?',array['about two','more than twenty','more than a hundred','exactly five']::text[],'B','''More than twenty local businesses.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','The old market hall in the town centre, which closed five years ago, will reopen next spring as a food hall. More than twenty local businesses will sell food from around the world, and there will be space for live music at weekends. The council hopes the project will bring more visitors to the town centre, where many shops have closed recently. However, some residents are worried about noise late at night.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:b78076dbb536','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How did the writer prepare for the interview?',array['did nothing','asked a teacher to call them','bought new clothes','read about the company and practised answers']::text[],'D','''I prepared by reading about the company and practising answers with a friend.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Last week I had my first job interview since leaving university. I prepared by reading about the company and practising answers with a friend. On the day, I arrived twenty minutes early, which gave me time to relax. The interview was more relaxed than I expected — they asked about my studies and a group project I had led. At the end they asked if I had any questions, and I asked about training opportunities. They phoned me two days later to offer me the job!',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:0720d24ca16c','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Why was arriving early helpful?',array['They met the manager.','It gave the writer time to relax.','They could read the job advert.','They could start the interview sooner.']::text[],'B','''...which gave me time to relax.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Last week I had my first job interview since leaving university. I prepared by reading about the company and practising answers with a friend. On the day, I arrived twenty minutes early, which gave me time to relax. The interview was more relaxed than I expected — they asked about my studies and a group project I had led. At the end they asked if I had any questions, and I asked about training opportunities. They phoned me two days later to offer me the job!',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:6b6c7d895bc7','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What did the writer ask at the end?',array['about holidays','about training opportunities','nothing','about the salary']::text[],'B','''I asked about training opportunities.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Last week I had my first job interview since leaving university. I prepared by reading about the company and practising answers with a friend. On the day, I arrived twenty minutes early, which gave me time to relax. The interview was more relaxed than I expected — they asked about my studies and a group project I had led. At the end they asked if I had any questions, and I asked about training opportunities. They phoned me two days later to offer me the job!',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:526aa4d9f9d0','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What was the result?',array['The writer was rejected.','The writer hasn''t heard back.','There was a second interview.','The writer got the job.']::text[],'D','''They phoned me two days later to offer me the job!''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Last week I had my first job interview since leaving university. I prepared by reading about the company and practising answers with a friend. On the day, I arrived twenty minutes early, which gave me time to relax. The interview was more relaxed than I expected — they asked about my studies and a group project I had led. At the end they asked if I had any questions, and I asked about training opportunities. They phoned me two days later to offer me the job!',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:da27a0b557d0','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How do some shops help customers produce less waste?',array['They sell only fresh food.','They close earlier.','They let them bring their own containers.','They give free bags.']::text[],'C','''Some shops now let customers bring their own containers.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','More and more people in the UK are trying to produce less waste. Some shops now let customers bring their own containers to buy rice, pasta and cleaning products, so there is no plastic packaging. Supporters say this can save money as well as help the environment, because you only buy the amount you need. Critics point out that these shops are still rare outside big cities, and that the products are sometimes more expensive.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:f569df40c7f9','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Why can buying this way save money, according to supporters?',array['Delivery is free.','You get discounts for containers.','You only buy what you need.','Products are always cheaper.']::text[],'C','''...because you only buy the amount you need.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','More and more people in the UK are trying to produce less waste. Some shops now let customers bring their own containers to buy rice, pasta and cleaning products, so there is no plastic packaging. Supporters say this can save money as well as help the environment, because you only buy the amount you need. Critics point out that these shops are still rare outside big cities, and that the products are sometimes more expensive.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:d3bcc90ebf96','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What is one criticism mentioned?',array['They are always crowded.','The food is unhealthy.','They use too much plastic.','The shops are rare outside big cities.']::text[],'D','''Critics point out that these shops are still rare outside big cities.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','More and more people in the UK are trying to produce less waste. Some shops now let customers bring their own containers to buy rice, pasta and cleaning products, so there is no plastic packaging. Supporters say this can save money as well as help the environment, because you only buy the amount you need. Critics point out that these shops are still rare outside big cities, and that the products are sometimes more expensive.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:01227653d879','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','In what way do young children often learn better?',array['They are more motivated.','They learn grammar faster.','They develop a better accent.','They study more.']::text[],'C','''Young children often develop a better accent.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Many people believe that children learn languages more easily than adults. It is true that young children often develop a better accent. However, research shows that teenagers and adults can learn grammar and vocabulary faster, because they can use study strategies and understand rules. The most important thing, experts say, is not age but how much time you spend using the language and how motivated you are.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:9ac44096dc59','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Why can older learners learn grammar faster?',array['They can use study strategies and understand rules.','They don''t make mistakes.','They have better memories.','They have more free time.']::text[],'A','''...because they can use study strategies and understand rules.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Many people believe that children learn languages more easily than adults. It is true that young children often develop a better accent. However, research shows that teenagers and adults can learn grammar and vocabulary faster, because they can use study strategies and understand rules. The most important thing, experts say, is not age but how much time you spend using the language and how motivated you are.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:96608ddf10ab','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','According to experts, what matters most?',array['having a good accent','starting before age five','living abroad','time spent using the language and motivation']::text[],'D','''The most important thing... is not age but how much time you spend using the language and how motivated you are.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Many people believe that children learn languages more easily than adults. It is true that young children often develop a better accent. However, research shows that teenagers and adults can learn grammar and vocabulary faster, because they can use study strategies and understand rules. The most important thing, experts say, is not age but how much time you spend using the language and how motivated you are.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:2345642ad8af','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What did the writer like about the cottage?',array['The road was wide.','It was close to the shops.','It was clean and warm with great views.','The weather was sunny.']::text[],'C','''The cottage itself was lovely — clean, warm and full of character.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','We rented a cottage in the Lake District for a week in October. The cottage itself was lovely — clean, warm and full of character — and the views over the lake were amazing. However, it was at the end of a long, narrow road, and the nearest shop was a 25-minute drive away, so we had to plan our meals carefully. It also rained for four of the seven days. Still, we would definitely go back, perhaps in summer.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:0d2794a2710f','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Why did they have to plan meals carefully?',array['They were on a diet.','The nearest shop was a long drive away.','The cottage had no kitchen.','Food was very expensive.']::text[],'B','''...the nearest shop was a 25-minute drive away.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','We rented a cottage in the Lake District for a week in October. The cottage itself was lovely — clean, warm and full of character — and the views over the lake were amazing. However, it was at the end of a long, narrow road, and the nearest shop was a 25-minute drive away, so we had to plan our meals carefully. It also rained for four of the seven days. Still, we would definitely go back, perhaps in summer.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:e22a6dc80eaf','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How many days did it rain?',array['two','none','four','seven']::text[],'C','''It also rained for four of the seven days.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','We rented a cottage in the Lake District for a week in October. The cottage itself was lovely — clean, warm and full of character — and the views over the lake were amazing. However, it was at the end of a long, narrow road, and the nearest shop was a 25-minute drive away, so we had to plan our meals carefully. It also rained for four of the seven days. Still, we would definitely go back, perhaps in summer.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:7090aec3ea0e','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Would the writer go back?',array['Yes, next October.','Yes, perhaps in summer.','Only if the road is improved.','No, never.']::text[],'B','''Still, we would definitely go back, perhaps in summer.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','We rented a cottage in the Lake District for a week in October. The cottage itself was lovely — clean, warm and full of character — and the views over the lake were amazing. However, it was at the end of a long, narrow road, and the nearest shop was a 25-minute drive away, so we had to plan our meals carefully. It also rained for four of the seven days. Still, we would definitely go back, perhaps in summer.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:2d688a2164e2','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','When does the Notting Hill Carnival take place?',array['on the August bank holiday weekend','at Christmas','in the 1960s only','every Sunday in summer']::text[],'A','''...every August bank holiday weekend.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','The Notting Hill Carnival takes place in west London every August bank holiday weekend. It started in the 1960s as a way for the Caribbean community to celebrate their culture. Today it is one of the largest street festivals in Europe, attracting around a million people. Visitors can enjoy steel bands, colourful costumes and Caribbean food. Because it is so crowded, the police advise visitors to arrange a meeting point in case they lose their friends.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:90299d6779b0','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Why did the carnival start?',array['to celebrate Caribbean culture','to celebrate the police','to welcome tourists','to raise money for London']::text[],'A','''...as a way for the Caribbean community to celebrate their culture.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','The Notting Hill Carnival takes place in west London every August bank holiday weekend. It started in the 1960s as a way for the Caribbean community to celebrate their culture. Today it is one of the largest street festivals in Europe, attracting around a million people. Visitors can enjoy steel bands, colourful costumes and Caribbean food. Because it is so crowded, the police advise visitors to arrange a meeting point in case they lose their friends.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:d3405aad96a4','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What do the police advise visitors to do?',array['arrange a meeting point','arrive by car','stay at home','bring their own food']::text[],'A','''...arrange a meeting point in case they lose their friends.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','The Notting Hill Carnival takes place in west London every August bank holiday weekend. It started in the 1960s as a way for the Caribbean community to celebrate their culture. Today it is one of the largest street festivals in Europe, attracting around a million people. Visitors can enjoy steel bands, colourful costumes and Caribbean food. Because it is so crowded, the police advise visitors to arrange a meeting point in case they lose their friends.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:57f5a25d5747','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How many people attend, approximately?',array['five million','about 100,000','around a million','around ten thousand']::text[],'C','''...attracting around a million people.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','The Notting Hill Carnival takes place in west London every August bank holiday weekend. It started in the 1960s as a way for the Caribbean community to celebrate their culture. Today it is one of the largest street festivals in Europe, attracting around a million people. Visitors can enjoy steel bands, colourful costumes and Caribbean food. Because it is so crowded, the police advise visitors to arrange a meeting point in case they lose their friends.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:ad5056c02fc6','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What does the robot do?',array['treats patients','cleans the floors','answers phones','delivers medicine and supplies']::text[],'D','''...to deliver medicine and supplies between departments.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','A hospital in Manchester has started using a small robot to deliver medicine and supplies between departments. The robot travels along the corridors on its own and can even use the lifts. Nurses say it saves them a lot of walking, so they can spend more time with patients. The hospital says the robot is not designed to replace staff, but to help them with simple, repetitive tasks.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:b894e5b318c7','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How does the robot help nurses?',array['It does their paperwork.','It gives injections.','It replaces night staff.','They walk less and spend more time with patients.']::text[],'D','''It saves them a lot of walking, so they can spend more time with patients.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','A hospital in Manchester has started using a small robot to deliver medicine and supplies between departments. The robot travels along the corridors on its own and can even use the lifts. Nurses say it saves them a lot of walking, so they can spend more time with patients. The hospital says the robot is not designed to replace staff, but to help them with simple, repetitive tasks.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:8eab860fbcde','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What does the hospital say about staff?',array['The robot is not meant to replace them.','Nurses don''t like it.','Fewer nurses will be needed.','Staff must train the robot daily.']::text[],'A','''The robot is not designed to replace staff.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','A hospital in Manchester has started using a small robot to deliver medicine and supplies between departments. The robot travels along the corridors on its own and can even use the lifts. Nurses say it saves them a lot of walking, so they can spend more time with patients. The hospital says the robot is not designed to replace staff, but to help them with simple, repetitive tasks.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:30567c9d5167','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Where did the writer stay in Lyon?',array['with a French family','at the school','with Chloé''s teacher','in a hotel']::text[],'A','''I stayed with a French family, the Moreaus.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Last spring I spent three weeks in Lyon on a school exchange. I stayed with a French family, the Moreaus, whose daughter Chloé came to stay with us in the summer. At first I was nervous about speaking French, but the family were very patient. I went to school with Chloé every day, and in the evenings we often cooked together. The thing that surprised me most was how late they ate dinner — usually after eight o''clock!',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:df500645c328','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How did the family help the writer?',array['They spoke English all the time.','They were patient when the writer spoke French.','They cooked every meal.','They gave French lessons.']::text[],'B','''The family were very patient.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Last spring I spent three weeks in Lyon on a school exchange. I stayed with a French family, the Moreaus, whose daughter Chloé came to stay with us in the summer. At first I was nervous about speaking French, but the family were very patient. I went to school with Chloé every day, and in the evenings we often cooked together. The thing that surprised me most was how late they ate dinner — usually after eight o''clock!',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:31efeb41e74f','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What surprised the writer most?',array['how much French Chloé spoke','how late the family ate dinner','how big the school was','how cold it was']::text[],'B','''...how late they ate dinner — usually after eight o''clock!''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Last spring I spent three weeks in Lyon on a school exchange. I stayed with a French family, the Moreaus, whose daughter Chloé came to stay with us in the summer. At first I was nervous about speaking French, but the family were very patient. I went to school with Chloé every day, and in the evenings we often cooked together. The thing that surprised me most was how late they ate dinner — usually after eight o''clock!',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:7b5debe709a0','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What happened in the summer?',array['The writer went back to Lyon.','The writer started school in France.','The Moreaus moved to England.','Chloé came to stay with the writer''s family.']::text[],'D','''...whose daughter Chloé came to stay with us in the summer.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Last spring I spent three weeks in Lyon on a school exchange. I stayed with a French family, the Moreaus, whose daughter Chloé came to stay with us in the summer. At first I was nervous about speaking French, but the family were very patient. I went to school with Chloé every day, and in the evenings we often cooked together. The thing that surprised me most was how late they ate dinner — usually after eight o''clock!',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:a56e4091a995','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How much did Priya save in her first year?',array['£100','£10,000','a third of her money','£1,000']::text[],'D','''Priya managed to save £1,000 during her first year.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Welcome to this week''s episode of ''Money Matters''. Today we''re talking about student budgets. Our guest, Priya, managed to save £1,000 during her first year at university. Her tips? Cook in batches at the weekend, buy second-hand textbooks, and use a student railcard, which gives a third off most train fares. She also recommends checking your bank account every week, so there are no surprises.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:b8db1a8d820c','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What does a student railcard give?',array['free train travel','cheaper food','a third off most train fares','half-price books']::text[],'C','''...which gives a third off most train fares.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Welcome to this week''s episode of ''Money Matters''. Today we''re talking about student budgets. Our guest, Priya, managed to save £1,000 during her first year at university. Her tips? Cook in batches at the weekend, buy second-hand textbooks, and use a student railcard, which gives a third off most train fares. She also recommends checking your bank account every week, so there are no surprises.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:e28c3ec6dbf4','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Why does Priya check her account every week?',array['to pay her rent','because the bank asks','to earn interest','so there are no surprises']::text[],'D','''...so there are no surprises.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Welcome to this week''s episode of ''Money Matters''. Today we''re talking about student budgets. Our guest, Priya, managed to save £1,000 during her first year at university. Her tips? Cook in batches at the weekend, buy second-hand textbooks, and use a student railcard, which gives a third off most train fares. She also recommends checking your bank account every week, so there are no surprises.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:03d6a328402a','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Which tip does Priya NOT give?',array['take a part-time job','buy second-hand textbooks','use a student railcard','cook in batches']::text[],'A','The tips are batch cooking, second-hand books, a railcard and checking the account.',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Welcome to this week''s episode of ''Money Matters''. Today we''re talking about student budgets. Our guest, Priya, managed to save £1,000 during her first year at university. Her tips? Cook in batches at the weekend, buy second-hand textbooks, and use a student railcard, which gives a third off most train fares. She also recommends checking your bank account every week, so there are no surprises.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:4c03dfa17cef','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Why was Ms Clark''s sofa late?',array['bad weather','a wrong address','a problem at the factory','a missing payment']::text[],'C','''This was caused by a problem at our factory.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Dear Ms Clark, Thank you for your email about the delay to your order. I am very sorry that your sofa did not arrive on the date we promised. This was caused by a problem at our factory. Your sofa will now be delivered on Thursday 9th March between 8 am and 1 pm. As an apology, we will refund the £45 delivery charge. Please let us know if this date is not convenient. Yours sincerely, Mark Hill, Customer Services',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:7c612258f774','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What will the company refund?',array['the £45 delivery charge','half the price','nothing','the price of the sofa']::text[],'A','''We will refund the £45 delivery charge.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Dear Ms Clark, Thank you for your email about the delay to your order. I am very sorry that your sofa did not arrive on the date we promised. This was caused by a problem at our factory. Your sofa will now be delivered on Thursday 9th March between 8 am and 1 pm. As an apology, we will refund the £45 delivery charge. Please let us know if this date is not convenient. Yours sincerely, Mark Hill, Customer Services',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:020a7ed212bc','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','When will the sofa now arrive?',array['Thursday 9th March, in the morning','next week','Thursday afternoon','it is not decided']::text[],'A','''...on Thursday 9th March between 8 am and 1 pm.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Dear Ms Clark, Thank you for your email about the delay to your order. I am very sorry that your sofa did not arrive on the date we promised. This was caused by a problem at our factory. Your sofa will now be delivered on Thursday 9th March between 8 am and 1 pm. As an apology, we will refund the £45 delivery charge. Please let us know if this date is not convenient. Yours sincerely, Mark Hill, Customer Services',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:726d262ae286','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What should Ms Clark do if the date is not convenient?',array['collect the sofa herself','cancel the order','let the company know','call the factory']::text[],'C','''Please let us know if this date is not convenient.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Dear Ms Clark, Thank you for your email about the delay to your order. I am very sorry that your sofa did not arrive on the date we promised. This was caused by a problem at our factory. Your sofa will now be delivered on Thursday 9th March between 8 am and 1 pm. As an apology, we will refund the £45 delivery charge. Please let us know if this date is not convenient. Yours sincerely, Mark Hill, Customer Services',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:bd52daaf90b8','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What happened when Eyjafjallajökull erupted in 2010?',array['The volcano was the largest ever.','European airspace was largely closed for days.','Flights to Iceland were cheaper.','Iceland''s capital was destroyed.']::text[],'B','''...much of the airspace over Europe was closed for six days.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Iceland has more than 30 active volcanoes. In 2010, the eruption of Eyjafjallajökull sent a huge cloud of ash into the sky, and much of the airspace over Europe was closed for six days. Around 100,000 flights were cancelled and millions of passengers were stuck. Although the eruption was not especially large, the wind carried the ash south-east towards the rest of Europe, which made the situation much worse.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:796570cff8bb','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Why did the eruption cause so many problems?',array['It was the biggest eruption in history.','It lasted for years.','It happened in summer.','The wind carried the ash towards Europe.']::text[],'D','''...the wind carried the ash south-east... which made the situation much worse.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Iceland has more than 30 active volcanoes. In 2010, the eruption of Eyjafjallajökull sent a huge cloud of ash into the sky, and much of the airspace over Europe was closed for six days. Around 100,000 flights were cancelled and millions of passengers were stuck. Although the eruption was not especially large, the wind carried the ash south-east towards the rest of Europe, which made the situation much worse.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:f1453050f2db','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How many flights were cancelled?',array['six million','30','around 1,000','around 100,000']::text[],'D','''Around 100,000 flights were cancelled.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Iceland has more than 30 active volcanoes. In 2010, the eruption of Eyjafjallajökull sent a huge cloud of ash into the sky, and much of the airspace over Europe was closed for six days. Around 100,000 flights were cancelled and millions of passengers were stuck. Although the eruption was not especially large, the wind carried the ash south-east towards the rest of Europe, which made the situation much worse.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:dcf8e11869d0','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How much did the writer use their phone during the detox?',array['not at all','one hour a day','one day a week','only at night']::text[],'B','''...use my phone for only one hour a day.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Last month I decided to have a ''digital detox'' and use my phone for only one hour a day. The first few days were difficult: I kept reaching for my phone without thinking. But by the end of the first week I was sleeping better and reading more. I also realised how much time I had wasted scrolling through social media. I now use an app that blocks certain websites after 9 pm, and I leave my phone in the kitchen at night.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:b0c8faeedffd','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What changed by the end of the first week?',array['The writer stopped using the phone completely.','The writer felt more stressed.','The writer deleted social media.','The writer slept better and read more.']::text[],'D','''...by the end of the first week I was sleeping better and reading more.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Last month I decided to have a ''digital detox'' and use my phone for only one hour a day. The first few days were difficult: I kept reaching for my phone without thinking. But by the end of the first week I was sleeping better and reading more. I also realised how much time I had wasted scrolling through social media. I now use an app that blocks certain websites after 9 pm, and I leave my phone in the kitchen at night.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:882e63a661ff','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What does the writer do now at night?',array['leaves the phone in the kitchen','reads on the phone','turns the phone off at 6 pm','sleeps with the phone']::text[],'A','''I leave my phone in the kitchen at night.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Last month I decided to have a ''digital detox'' and use my phone for only one hour a day. The first few days were difficult: I kept reaching for my phone without thinking. But by the end of the first week I was sleeping better and reading more. I also realised how much time I had wasted scrolling through social media. I now use an app that blocks certain websites after 9 pm, and I leave my phone in the kitchen at night.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:5388043f3083','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How did the original Globe Theatre burn down?',array['A candle fell over.','A cannon fired during a play set the roof on fire.','Lightning hit it.','Someone set fire to it on purpose.']::text[],'B','''...a cannon fired as part of the show set the roof alight.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','The Globe Theatre in London is a reconstruction of the theatre where many of Shakespeare''s plays were first performed. The original building burned down in 1613 during a performance of Henry VIII, when a cannon fired as part of the show set the roof alight. The modern Globe opened in 1997, close to the original site. Like the original, it has no roof over the centre, so some audience members stand in the open air.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:54ecc1519859','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','When did the modern Globe open?',array['1613','2007','1997','1600']::text[],'C','''The modern Globe opened in 1997.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','The Globe Theatre in London is a reconstruction of the theatre where many of Shakespeare''s plays were first performed. The original building burned down in 1613 during a performance of Henry VIII, when a cannon fired as part of the show set the roof alight. The modern Globe opened in 1997, close to the original site. Like the original, it has no roof over the centre, so some audience members stand in the open air.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:2fe544e52faf','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What is unusual about the Globe''s design?',array['It has no seats at all.','There is no roof over the centre.','It has no stage.','It is underground.']::text[],'B','''It has no roof over the centre, so some audience members stand in the open air.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','The Globe Theatre in London is a reconstruction of the theatre where many of Shakespeare''s plays were first performed. The original building burned down in 1613 during a performance of Henry VIII, when a cannon fired as part of the show set the roof alight. The modern Globe opened in 1997, close to the original site. Like the original, it has no roof over the centre, so some audience members stand in the open air.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:123964548ebd','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What does the advice column recommend first?',array['stop washing up yourself','move out','tell the landlord','talk at a calm moment']::text[],'D','''Choose a calm moment, not when you are angry.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Q: My flatmate never does the washing-up and leaves the kitchen in a mess. I don''t want to argue, but I''m getting really annoyed. What should I do? — A: Choose a calm moment, not when you are angry, and explain how you feel. Avoid blaming language like ''You never...''; instead say ''I feel stressed when the kitchen is messy.'' Then suggest a simple rota so that you share the jobs fairly. Most people respond better to a clear plan than to criticism.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:be9633302225','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Why should you avoid saying ''You never...''?',array['It isn''t polite English.','It makes you feel stressed.','It sounds like blaming.','It is too long.']::text[],'C','''Avoid blaming language like ''You never...''''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Q: My flatmate never does the washing-up and leaves the kitchen in a mess. I don''t want to argue, but I''m getting really annoyed. What should I do? — A: Choose a calm moment, not when you are angry, and explain how you feel. Avoid blaming language like ''You never...''; instead say ''I feel stressed when the kitchen is messy.'' Then suggest a simple rota so that you share the jobs fairly. Most people respond better to a clear plan than to criticism.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:132b5c77104f','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What practical solution is suggested?',array['eating out','hiring a cleaner','a rota to share the jobs','buying a dishwasher']::text[],'C','''...suggest a simple rota so that you share the jobs fairly.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Q: My flatmate never does the washing-up and leaves the kitchen in a mess. I don''t want to argue, but I''m getting really annoyed. What should I do? — A: Choose a calm moment, not when you are angry, and explain how you feel. Avoid blaming language like ''You never...''; instead say ''I feel stressed when the kitchen is messy.'' Then suggest a simple rota so that you share the jobs fairly. Most people respond better to a clear plan than to criticism.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:37f93ac56c68','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How far is a parkrun?',array['1 kilometre','13 kilometres','5 kilometres','10 kilometres']::text[],'C','''...a free, weekly 5-kilometre run.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Parkrun is a free, weekly 5-kilometre run that takes place every Saturday morning in parks around the UK. It started in London in 2004 with just 13 runners. Today hundreds of thousands of people take part each week. You don''t have to be fast — many people walk the course, and some bring their dogs or push buggies. Volunteers organise each event, and runners only need to register online once and print a barcode.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:99aafda59c7b','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How many people ran in the first parkrun?',array['13','a few hundred','5','2004']::text[],'A','''It started in London in 2004 with just 13 runners.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Parkrun is a free, weekly 5-kilometre run that takes place every Saturday morning in parks around the UK. It started in London in 2004 with just 13 runners. Today hundreds of thousands of people take part each week. You don''t have to be fast — many people walk the course, and some bring their dogs or push buggies. Volunteers organise each event, and runners only need to register online once and print a barcode.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:b531e898d81c','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Who organises each event?',array['volunteers','the council','the runners'' families','professional coaches']::text[],'A','''Volunteers organise each event.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Parkrun is a free, weekly 5-kilometre run that takes place every Saturday morning in parks around the UK. It started in London in 2004 with just 13 runners. Today hundreds of thousands of people take part each week. You don''t have to be fast — many people walk the course, and some bring their dogs or push buggies. Volunteers organise each event, and runners only need to register online once and print a barcode.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:4aabdeb82912','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What does the text suggest about speed?',array['You can walk if you want.','Dogs are not allowed.','Only fast runners can take part.','You must finish in 30 minutes.']::text[],'A','''You don''t have to be fast — many people walk the course.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Parkrun is a free, weekly 5-kilometre run that takes place every Saturday morning in parks around the UK. It started in London in 2004 with just 13 runners. Today hundreds of thousands of people take part each week. You don''t have to be fast — many people walk the course, and some bring their dogs or push buggies. Volunteers organise each event, and runners only need to register online once and print a barcode.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:97332b977fde','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How often is the Fix-It Café open?',array['every second Sunday of the month','every Sunday','once a year','every weekday']::text[],'A','''Every second Sunday of the month.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Fix-It Café: Bring your broken things and learn to repair them! Every second Sunday of the month, 11 am – 3 pm, at St Mark''s Church Hall. Our volunteers can help with clothes, small electrical items, bikes and furniture. Repairs are free, but donations are welcome. Please note: we can''t repair mobile phones or anything that uses gas.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:50c037c67f42','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How much do repairs cost?',array['£5 each','nothing, but donations are welcome','it depends on the item','only bikes are free']::text[],'B','''Repairs are free, but donations are welcome.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Fix-It Café: Bring your broken things and learn to repair them! Every second Sunday of the month, 11 am – 3 pm, at St Mark''s Church Hall. Our volunteers can help with clothes, small electrical items, bikes and furniture. Repairs are free, but donations are welcome. Please note: we can''t repair mobile phones or anything that uses gas.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:380271e9f897','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Which item can they NOT repair?',array['a mobile phone','a jacket','a bike','a lamp']::text[],'A','''We can''t repair mobile phones or anything that uses gas.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Fix-It Café: Bring your broken things and learn to repair them! Every second Sunday of the month, 11 am – 3 pm, at St Mark''s Church Hall. Our volunteers can help with clothes, small electrical items, bikes and furniture. Repairs are free, but donations are welcome. Please note: we can''t repair mobile phones or anything that uses gas.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:7bc18cc88d4b','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What is the main aim of the Fix-It Café?',array['to help people learn to repair things','to raise money for the church','to sell second-hand items','to recycle old phones']::text[],'A','''Bring your broken things and learn to repair them!''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Fix-It Café: Bring your broken things and learn to repair them! Every second Sunday of the month, 11 am – 3 pm, at St Mark''s Church Hall. Our volunteers can help with clothes, small electrical items, bikes and furniture. Repairs are free, but donations are welcome. Please note: we can''t repair mobile phones or anything that uses gas.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:816d0b7bb07e','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How long is Tom''s ride to work?',array['fifteen kilometres','eight kilometres','three kilometres','one kilometre']::text[],'B','''...cycling the eight kilometres to his office.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','When Tom''s car broke down for the third time in a month, he decided not to repair it. Instead, he bought a second-hand bike and started cycling the eight kilometres to his office in Leicester. The first week was hard: his legs hurt and he arrived at work hot and tired. But after a month he was enjoying the ride, and he had lost three kilos. He now saves about £150 a month on petrol and parking. The only thing he doesn''t like is cycling in heavy rain, so on very wet days he takes the bus.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:5d600265ca5a','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What does the app send?',array['adverts by email','text messages to teachers','reminders','exam results']::text[],'C','''It also sends reminders.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','I downloaded ''StudyBuddy'', a free app that helps students organise their revision. You enter your exam dates and subjects, and it creates a timetable for you. It also sends reminders and lets you test yourself with flashcards. I found it really useful, although the free version shows quite a lot of adverts. The paid version (£2.99 a month) removes them and adds progress reports. My only real complaint is that it sometimes crashes when you add a lot of subjects.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:a776e7e4e955','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Which house number does Alan live at?',array['He doesn''t say.','40','14','4']::text[],'C','''Alan (number 14)''.',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Dear Mrs Jones, I''m writing about the tree in your garden next to my house. Over the last few years it has grown very tall, and it now blocks most of the light from my kitchen window. Some branches also hang over my fence, and their leaves fill my garden in autumn. I wonder if you would consider cutting it back a little. I would be happy to share the cost. Perhaps we could talk about it this weekend? Best wishes, Alan (number 14)',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:cf43e7baf1d7','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','When will the food hall open?',array['this autumn','next spring','in five years','next week']::text[],'B','''...will reopen next spring as a food hall.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','The old market hall in the town centre, which closed five years ago, will reopen next spring as a food hall. More than twenty local businesses will sell food from around the world, and there will be space for live music at weekends. The council hopes the project will bring more visitors to the town centre, where many shops have closed recently. However, some residents are worried about noise late at night.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:7c72112e428d','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How did the interview feel to the writer?',array['more relaxed than expected','very stressful','boring','too short']::text[],'A','''The interview was more relaxed than I expected.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Last week I had my first job interview since leaving university. I prepared by reading about the company and practising answers with a friend. On the day, I arrived twenty minutes early, which gave me time to relax. The interview was more relaxed than I expected — they asked about my studies and a group project I had led. At the end they asked if I had any questions, and I asked about training opportunities. They phoned me two days later to offer me the job!',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:88afc32feea0','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Where does the modern Globe stand?',array['outside London','close to the original site','exactly on the original site','in Stratford']::text[],'B','''...close to the original site.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','The Globe Theatre in London is a reconstruction of the theatre where many of Shakespeare''s plays were first performed. The original building burned down in 1613 during a performance of Henry VIII, when a cannon fired as part of the show set the roof alight. The modern Globe opened in 1997, close to the original site. Like the original, it has no roof over the centre, so some audience members stand in the open air.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:e3b5f9774e09','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Who did the office raise money for?',array['the office party','an animal shelter','a local children''s hospital','a school']::text[],'C','''...to raise money for a local children''s hospital.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Last year our office decided to raise money for a local children''s hospital. We organised a bake sale every Friday, a sponsored walk along the coast and a quiz night in a nearby pub. In total we raised £4,200, which was twice our original target. The hospital used the money to buy toys and games for the children''s ward. Several colleagues said the events also helped them get to know people from other departments.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:1750870a248a','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How did the final amount compare with their target?',array['They didn''t have a target.','It was double the target.','It was half the target.','It was exactly the target.']::text[],'B','''£4,200, which was twice our original target.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Last year our office decided to raise money for a local children''s hospital. We organised a bake sale every Friday, a sponsored walk along the coast and a quiz night in a nearby pub. In total we raised £4,200, which was twice our original target. The hospital used the money to buy toys and games for the children''s ward. Several colleagues said the events also helped them get to know people from other departments.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:b5be8773dbd3','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What did the hospital buy?',array['beds','a new building','toys and games','medicine']::text[],'C','''The hospital used the money to buy toys and games.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Last year our office decided to raise money for a local children''s hospital. We organised a bake sale every Friday, a sponsored walk along the coast and a quiz night in a nearby pub. In total we raised £4,200, which was twice our original target. The hospital used the money to buy toys and games for the children''s ward. Several colleagues said the events also helped them get to know people from other departments.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:c06439309e27','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What unexpected benefit did colleagues mention?',array['winning the quiz','getting a day off','learning to bake','meeting people from other departments']::text[],'D','''...helped them get to know people from other departments.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','Last year our office decided to raise money for a local children''s hospital. We organised a bake sale every Friday, a sponsored walk along the coast and a quiz night in a nearby pub. In total we raised £4,200, which was twice our original target. The hospital used the money to buy toys and games for the children''s ward. Several colleagues said the events also helped them get to know people from other departments.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:beceb0302cf4','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How do users unlock a bike?',array['by phoning the council','with a key from a shop','by scanning a code with the app','by paying cash']::text[],'C','''...unlock a bike by scanning a code.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','The city has introduced a bike-sharing scheme with 500 bikes at 40 stations. Users download an app, unlock a bike by scanning a code, and return it to any station. The first 30 minutes of each ride are free; after that it costs £1 for every extra half hour. The scheme has been popular with commuters, but some residents complain that bikes are sometimes left on the pavement.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:b46e78faafb7','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How much does a 45-minute ride cost?',array['£2','nothing','£1.50','£1']::text[],'D','The first 30 minutes are free, then £1 per extra half hour.',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','The city has introduced a bike-sharing scheme with 500 bikes at 40 stations. Users download an app, unlock a bike by scanning a code, and return it to any station. The first 30 minutes of each ride are free; after that it costs £1 for every extra half hour. The scheme has been popular with commuters, but some residents complain that bikes are sometimes left on the pavement.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:abe79a40ce66','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What do some residents complain about?',array['bikes left on the pavement','too few stations','the app','the price']::text[],'A','''...some residents complain that bikes are sometimes left on the pavement.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','The city has introduced a bike-sharing scheme with 500 bikes at 40 stations. Users download an app, unlock a bike by scanning a code, and return it to any station. The first 30 minutes of each ride are free; after that it costs £1 for every extra half hour. The scheme has been popular with commuters, but some residents complain that bikes are sometimes left on the pavement.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:834278b52455','B1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Where can you return a bike?',array['anywhere in the street','at any station','at the council office','only where you took it']::text[],'B','''...return it to any station.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08','The city has introduced a bike-sharing scheme with 500 bikes at 40 stations. Users download an app, unlock a bike by scanning a code, and return it to any station. The first 30 minutes of each ride are free; after that it costs £1 for every extra half hour. The scheme has been popular with commuters, but some residents complain that bikes are sometimes left on the pavement.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:217e2e3be0ba','B1'::public.cefr_level,'grammar','Had I known you were coming, I ___ a cake.',array['had baked','would bake','baked','would have baked']::text[],'D','Inverted third conditional: ''Had I known'' = ''If I had known''.',array['grammar']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08',null,null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:1457d317a82d','B1'::public.cefr_level,'grammar','She is thought ___ the best player in the team.',array['to be','be','that she is','being']::text[],'A','Reporting passive: is thought to be.',array['grammar']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08',null,null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-08:dc356b9ac0e8','B1'::public.cefr_level,'grammar','Not only ___ the exam, but she got the top mark.',array['did she pass','passed she','she did pass','she passed']::text[],'A','After ''Not only'' at the start, invert subject and auxiliary.',array['grammar']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-08',null,null,null,null,'practice'),
